      },
      {
        "key": "landing.conversations.eyebrow",
        "name": "Conversations: label",
        "max_length": 40,
        "text": "Conversations with Zeph"
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.conversations.heading_first_line",
        "name": "Conversations: heading, first line",
        "max_length": 30,
        "text": "Real conversations"
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.conversations.heading_second_line",
        "name": "Conversations: heading, second line",
        "max_length": 30,
        "text": "for real growth."
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.conversations.lead",
        "name": "Conversations: line under the heading",
        "max_length": 120,
        "text": "See how Zeph thinks, responds, and helps you go deeper."
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.conversations.message_1",
        "name": "Conversations: message 1, from Zeph",
        "max_length": 250,
        "text": "You've been pushing hard lately. How are you actually feeling beneath the momentum?"
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.conversations.message_2",
        "name": "Conversations: message 2, from the person",
        "max_length": 250,
        "text": "Honestly? Tired. But I'm also afraid to slow down. It feels like I'll fall behind if I do."
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.conversations.message_3",
        "name": "Conversations: message 3, from Zeph",
        "max_length": 250,
        "text": "That's a familiar pattern: equating rest with losing ground. What do you think you're really afraid of if you take a proper break?"
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.conversations.message_4",
        "name": "Conversations: message 4, from the person",
        "max_length": 250,
        "text": "Maybe that I'm not as capable as I think. That the progress will stop, and I'll be left with the same old doubts again."
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.conversations.message_5",
        "name": "Conversations: message 5, from Zeph",
        "max_length": 250,
        "text": "That's a useful insight. It sounds less about productivity and more about self-trust. What would it look like to rest as part of your progress, and not as a pause from it?"
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.conversations.message_6",
        "name": "Conversations: message 6, from the person",
        "max_length": 250,
        "text": "I'm thinking of a bigger change, maybe moving to a van and travelling for a while. It feels exciting, but also a bit reckless. Am I just escaping from something?"
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.conversations.message_7",
        "name": "Conversations: message 7, from Zeph",
        "max_length": 250,
        "text": "It could be both: an escape and a deliberate step toward a life that feels more like you. Let's unpack it. What are you hoping to find on the road, and what are you hoping to leave behind?"
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.day.eyebrow",
        "name": "A day with Zeph: label",
        "max_length": 40,
        "text": "A day with Zeph"
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.day.heading_first_line",
        "name": "A day with Zeph: heading, first line",
        "max_length": 30,
        "text": "A thoughtful presence"
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.day.heading_second_line",
        "name": "A day with Zeph: heading, second line",
        "max_length": 30,
        "text": "throughout your day."
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.day.lead",
        "name": "A day with Zeph: line under the heading",
        "max_length": 200,
        "text": "Not just when you ask, but when it matters. Zeph chooses the moment to reach out, and stays quiet when you need space."
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.day.check_ins.tag",
        "name": "A day with Zeph: first moment, tag",
        "max_length": 24,
        "text": "Check-ins"
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.day.check_ins.title",
        "name": "A day with Zeph: first moment, title",
        "max_length": 40,
        "text": "It reaches out first, gently."
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.day.check_ins.text",
        "name": "A day with Zeph: first moment, text",
        "max_length": 160,
        "text": "Opt-in messages at times you choose. A question for the morning, never a streak to protect."
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.day.applied_wisdom.tag",
        "name": "A day with Zeph: second moment, tag",
        "max_length": 24,
        "text": "Applied wisdom"
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.day.applied_wisdom.title",
        "name": "A day with Zeph: second moment, title",
        "max_length": 40,
        "text": "Old ideas, when they are useful."
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.day.applied_wisdom.text",
        "name": "A day with Zeph: second moment, text",
        "max_length": 160,
        "text": "Eastern and Western philosophy, psychology and mindfulness, offered in plain words at the moment they apply."
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.day.reflection.tag",
        "name": "A day with Zeph: third moment, tag",
        "max_length": 24,
        "text": "Reflection"
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.day.reflection.title",
        "name": "A day with Zeph: third moment, title",
        "max_length": 40,
        "text": "A place to think out loud."
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.day.reflection.text",
        "name": "A day with Zeph: third moment, text",
        "max_length": 160,
        "text": "Talk through the day. Zeph asks, listens and disagrees when it should. It will not flatter you."
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.day.memory.tag",
        "name": "A day with Zeph: fourth moment, tag",
        "max_length": 24,
        "text": "Memory"
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.day.memory.title",
        "name": "A day with Zeph: fourth moment, title",
        "max_length": 40,
        "text": "It remembers, with permission."
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.day.memory.text",
        "name": "A day with Zeph: fourth moment, text",
        "max_length": 160,
        "text": "What you care about carries into tomorrow's conversation. You can read every memory and remove any of them."
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.faq.eyebrow",
        "name": "FAQ: label",
        "max_length": 40,
        "text": "FAQ"
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.faq.heading",
        "name": "FAQ: heading",
        "max_length": 40,
        "text": "Common questions."
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.faq.lead",
        "name": "FAQ: line under the heading",
        "max_length": 120,
        "text": "Everything you need to know about Zeph."
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.faq.question_1",
        "name": "FAQ: first question",
        "max_length": 80,
        "text": "What is Zeph?"
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.faq.answer_1",
        "name": "FAQ: first answer",
        "max_length": 400,
        "text": "Zeph is an AI companion you talk to on Telegram. It draws on philosophy, psychology and mindfulness to help you reflect, question your assumptions and decide what matters to you."
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.faq.question_2",
        "name": "FAQ: second question",
        "max_length": 80,
        "text": "How is this different from a regular AI chat?"
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.faq.answer_2",
        "name": "FAQ: second answer",
        "max_length": 400,
        "text": "Zeph remembers what you have told it, with your permission, and it can reach out first at times you choose. It is built to ask good questions, and it will disagree with you when that is more useful than agreeing."
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.faq.question_3",
        "name": "FAQ: third question",
        "max_length": 80,
        "text": "Will Zeph proactively check in with me?"
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.faq.answer_3",
        "name": "FAQ: third answer",
        "max_length": 400,
        "text": "Only if you turn check-ins on. You pick the times and how often in your dashboard, and you can switch them off at any time."
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.faq.question_4",
        "name": "FAQ: fourth question",
        "max_length": 80,
        "text": "Is my data private and secure?"
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.faq.answer_4",
        "name": "FAQ: fourth answer",
        "max_length": 400,
        "text": "You decide what Zeph remembers, and you can read, remove or export it from your dashboard. [YOUR DATA HANDLING DETAILS]"
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.faq.question_5",
        "name": "FAQ: fifth question",
        "max_length": 80,
        "text": "Can I cancel my subscription anytime?"
      },
      {
        "key": "landing.faq.answer_5",
        "name": "FAQ: fifth answer",
        "max_length": 400,
        "text": "[YOUR CANCELLATION POLICY]"
      }
    ]
  },
